The 6-th season of the Russian QuakeWorld League took place in autumn-winter of 2004. The tournament was supposed to be a qualifying tournament for [[Duelmania True masters]], but it dragged on due to the large number of participants. Unfortunately, Paradoks acted rudely and did not allow a single participant from [[Russia]] to participate in that [[Duelmania True masters]].

Due to unsportsmanlike behavior (he delayed several rounds in the winners and violated all deadlines), the player Ded was disqualified in the winners final and further and excluded from the final distribution of places.
The final distribution of places is as follows:

* 1.  {{Player|DooM|flag=ru}}
* 2.  {{Player|Delitel|flag=ru}}
* 3.  {{Player|Tyrannos|flag=ru}}
* 4-5.  {{Player|B1aze|flag=ru}} / {{Player|Slam|flag=ru}} 
* 6-7.  {{Player|gLAd|flag=ru}} / {{Player|Gorgoroth|flag=ru}}

